namespace MatCMS.Plugin.Moments;

/// <summary>
/// Every text of Moments as (key, German, English). <c>ctx.T</c> picks the request's language (the admin language in the back office, the page's on
/// the guest area); settings, block fields and sidebar links carry the keys themselves and the host looks them up. A test checks that each key the
/// code uses is here with both languages. The German texts are the plugin's wording from before it spoke English — change them only on purpose,
/// live sites show them. Keys with a counter come in pairs: <c>….1</c> (one) and <c>….n</c> (several), read through <see cref="M.Count"/>.
/// </summary>
